WEBVTT

00:04:59.253 --> 00:05:00.421
He didn't have a coat.

00:05:00.463 --> 00:05:03.174
He wore a Detroit Tigers baseball jacket.

00:05:03.674 --> 00:05:05.634
And he didn't have a winter hat,

00:05:05.676 --> 00:05:09.889
not a full one, he had a thin
worn skullcap that he wore.

00:05:10.723 --> 00:05:13.142
This is one of those days
where your teeth chatter.

00:05:13.142 --> 00:05:16.228
It's one of those days
where you can see your breath.

00:05:17.396 --> 00:05:18.606
And here's Jimmy.

00:05:18.647 --> 00:05:21.400
No scarf, no gloves.

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:26.155
And here's where we have to go
to a workforce development center

00:05:26.155 --> 00:05:28.074
that's at least a half-hour walk

00:05:28.074 --> 00:05:30.368
from where the last bus
could drop him off.